    "detailed_description": "Join Tiqee, a Human/Goblin half breed, on her adventures to escape the dungeon of Echeia.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFind hidden rooms, use the hook to overcome obstacles and fight your way through enemies with a twist on the turn based formula.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nManage your bot companions rather than doing everything yourself. Find and collect tools to improve your skills &amp; craft items to improve your bot companions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach bot has two distinct modifications, completely changing how they act in combat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features around 3-5 hours of gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you just an adventurer or are you a Platin-Gobbo? Beating the game will unlock a code for you in the future that can be used in Dungeon Rummage - Another Isekai?! And unlocking all achievements rewards even more goodies!",
